      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHEEZEL (8) has a strong record this track and trip with seven wins and 10 placings from 21 starts. In the money last time at this track (19.87) in a Free For All, finishing a half a length second. Looks suited here and rates on top. HEAR THE CROW (2) goes very well this course and distance starting 20 times for eight wins and five minors. Missed the frame latest (25.93) when eighth over 450m at this track in a Grade 5. Can feature with the right run. ROCKY PEPPER (1) showed good early burn and was there until turning but swamped late to finish 7th at this track in Mix 2/3 company. Form here at the trip sound including 21 wins. Reliable out of the boxes and should take advantage of the inside draw. Great chance to atone. ANNIHILATING (4) was unplaced here last start but gets his chance to atone.",
